  ✓ Check program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Rebuild semantics/proof from clean scratch and rerun every target claim
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and concrete witnesses
  ✓ Inventory and review every K declaration/rule for soundness
  ✓ Run a fresh meaningful non-vacuity mutation
  → Write proven-versus-assumed accounting and final REVIEW.md verdict
